  "question": {
    "text": "$\\text { If } z_{1}=\\sqrt{2}\\left[\\cos \\frac{\\pi}{4}+i \\sin \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right] \\text { and } z_{2}=\\sqrt{3}\\left[\\cos \\frac{\\pi}{3}+i \\sin \\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right]$ then $\\left|z_{1} z_{2}\\right|$ is equal to $\\sqrt{m}$. Value of $m$ is",
